<%# Response to POST /workspace/:workspace_id/roadmaps/:id/catagories: append %>
<%# the new category to the list at the bottom of the roadmap editor. The %>
<%# editor lives inside a turbo frame, but stream actions apply to the whole %>
<%# document, so this lands in place without reloading the frame. %>
<%= turbo_stream.append "roadmap-catagories-#{@roadmap.id}",
      partial: "workspace/files/items/roadmap_catagory",
      locals: { roadmap_catagory: @roadmap_catagory } %>